The flat is finally ready.
It is a real home now.
Nina knocks on the door.
She stands by the door with warm food.
"I brought two pizzas," she says.
We go into the living room.
There stands a small sofa by the wall.
We sit on the sofa together.
There lie two pizza boxes on the coffee table.
The boxes lie between us.
There also stand two glasses on the table.
We eat the warm pizzas.
"Welcome to your new flat," Nina says.
"Thank you very much," I reply.
We talk together for a long time.
My new plant stands in the window.
My slippers lie under the sofa.
Everything is in its place.
I am very happy with my new home.
